    "age encryption (rage, the Rust implementation of age-encryption.org/v1) in Vault’s shared core, the Keychain, PhotosUI, Vision, PDFKit and Quick Look. Vaults made by earlier versions are read with Apple CryptoKit and Apple Encrypted Archive until their first unlock updates them. Original files are preserved without recompression by Vault.": {
      "comment": "Vault interface copy. Keep it calm, concrete and short.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "age encryption (rage, the Rust implementation of age-encryption.org/v1) in Vault’s shared core, the Keychain, PhotosUI, Vision, PDFKit and Quick Look. Vaults made by earlier versions are read with Apple CryptoKit and Apple Encrypted Archive until their first unlock updates them. Original files are preserved without recompression by Vault."
          }
        }
      }
