    "Choose iCloud Drive or another folder in Files once. Changes are backed up while this vault is open. Completed encrypted backups can retry in the background; iOS decides when. If preparation is interrupted, open this vault again to catch up. The latest three copies made by this device are kept. Your provider handles cloud upload; a completed copy is not an upload receipt.": {
      "comment": "Vault interface copy. Keep it calm, concrete and short.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose iCloud Drive or another folder in Files once. Changes are backed up while this vault is open. Completed encrypted backups can retry in the background; iOS decides when. If preparation is interrupted, open this vault again to catch up. The latest three copies made by this device are kept. Your provider handles cloud upload; a completed copy is not an upload receipt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
